### VS Code REST Client examples. Use your real token in the environment, never commit secrets.
@base = http://localhost:3003

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### List blogs
GET {{base}}/api/blogs

### Register a user
POST {{base}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo_user","name":"Demo User","password":"demo_password123"}

### Log in (copy token into local variable securely if using REST Client)
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo_user","password":"demo_password123"}
